IDS=['arcane-clone','arcane-reversal','elemental-rebind','spell-sculptor','spell-seal','spell-theft','resonance-communion']
FORKS=[
('MM7-Q01',['arcane-clone'],'One illusionary copy for3rounds; no decoy routing/action profile printed.','A: earlier nonphysical audiovisual snapshot with30ft BA movement,60ft command range/LoE and three future regularSTARTs/18sec outside. B: only a stationary visual image or a real companion.','Recommend A as local new completion. No independent turn/senses/resources/body; no later shape/equipment snapshot refresh. Nonphysical image geometry is not a real Small/Medium body, but its declared visual form and surrounding perception remain explicit.'),
('MM7-Q02',['arcane-clone'],'Proposed adjacent decoy joins actual Mirror Image in one uniform candidate set.','A: one eligible selection before the original attack, only actual visible/reachable candidates, same currentAC, combined MirrorImage pool. B: serial independent miss chances or automatic image interception at any distance.','Recommend A only as an explicit new ArcaneClone interaction, not a silent rewrite of reviewed MirrorImage. Define source-qualified attack targeting for a separate apparent clone: ordinary AttackAction apparent targets versus creature-only spell selectors. Recognition/true sight and actual illusion-ignoring attacks retain exact scopes; no image hit triggers creature resources.'),
('MM7-Q03',['arcane-clone'],'Real contact recognition, suppression and visual selection randomness.','A: observer-specific known-false state persists through suppression, original attack lineage selects once, existing five Fate presentations remain unchanged. B: reset disbelief or expose a new Fate reroll category.','Recommend A. Physical passage gives that observer recognition; allied deliberate image farming remains invalid. Simulated casting supplies no Counterspell commitment. Preserve actual Ready triggers to genuine observed movement/sound without compelling a reaction.'),
('MM7-Q04',['arcane-reversal'],'Source reverse ongoing magic,Heal to Harm; old proposal supplies five inverse pairs and rank<=4 task gate.','A: retain five finite component-local pairs, ability+PB vs10+2rank, no concentration/max60sec or parent ending, one lifetime inversion. B: unlimited semantic inverse, permanent reversal or class/resource inversion.','Recommend A explicitly as new scope. Signed AC/attack/check/save, selected resistance/vulnerability and double/halfSpeed follow actual arbitration; immunity,hard control,maximumHP,RP,temporaryHP,creature creation and completed instantaneous effects are excluded. A whole parent is not rewritten by one component inversion.'),
('MM7-Q05',['arcane-reversal'],'Original8HP reserve scenario is synthetic; accepted rank4 WaterPet has real2d6 healing and a shared offensive/support activation.','A: preserve original reserve obligation conditionally and use actual WaterPet parent-output conversion for a source-qualified current example. B: invent a healing-reserve spell or borrow a class heal.','Recommend A. WaterPet current procedure explicitly makes heal or attack consume the same owner allowance; retain actual BA,pet action,5ft/LoE,willing eligible ally,original parent and pet dealer. Its no-conversion baseline requires this explicit new Reversal exception if chosen. It has no8unit reserve to debit, so cannot validate the synthetic reserve clause.'),
('MM7-Q06',['arcane-reversal'],'Converting a future output needs exact final-category funding, damage roots and original source provenance.','A: final heal/damage once, real earlier damage funding retained, no recursive conversion, retained actual source dealer and explicit root checkpoint when previously healing now creates damage. B: reuse mitigation twice, treat inverter as dealer or fund a lifetap from converted non-damage.','Recommend A. Specify for each actual output: if original damage has an existing root, pure transformation retains its provenance/Null flag; genuinely new damage from a healing-only opportunity needs a scoped actual-dealer checkpoint. Damage-to-heal creates no damage-dependent rider, Wound or damage resource. Accepted interfaces do not supply an unapproved generic conversion engine.'),
('MM7-Q07',['elemental-rebind'],'Target loses immunity/resistance to one element and takes5d10; duration/save unspecified.','A: earlier acid/cold/fire/lightning/thunder, CON half/no rider; failure suppress covered resistance/immunity before full damage until first future targetEND excluding underway/outside6sec. B: poison-inclusive random element, no save or permanent stripping.','Recommend A as explicit local design using accepted Lance five-type comparison, not ElementalDrain six-result table. Preserve initial damage independent of rider prevention, exact rational/defense order and actual transferred recipient defenses. No RP drain or vulnerability is granted.'),
('MM7-Q08',['elemental-rebind'],'All actual chosen-type resistance/immunity sources including later gained sources; unrelated protections remain.','A: selected-type overlay suppresses exactly covered type coverage, including matching portion of broader all-type resistance, with original sources/clocks retained. B: delete underlying defenses or suppress all invulnerability/survival/source-category protections.','Recommend A. Clarify conditional defense predicates and independently worded absolute protection with actual source examples. Rebind never removes Null nonlethal procedure, actual HP costs,flat reduction,tempHP or a different recipient immunity. Local suppression resumes only surviving original defense records, with no replayed5d10.'),
('MM7-Q09',['spell-sculptor'],'Source reshape AoE to exclude allies; proposed preparation and direct-recipient omission.','A: one60sec preparation for next actual rank0–6area cast, fixed perceived allied roster<=60/LoE at that cast commitment; consume before counters, no extra cast. B: arbitrary retroactive holes or free parent casting.','Recommend A as explicit new design. Current parent ranks, actual acquired permission and costs apply; no genuine roster leaves preparation pending. Countering/failing the committed parent still consumes the preparation. Parent owner/source stays independent of Sculptor caster.'),
('MM7-Q10',['spell-sculptor'],'Earlier text says still-living designated ally although source says allies without biological restriction.','A: use actual still-existing creature ally eligibility, including source-qualified active Undead/Construct bodies, no dead corpse/new replacement. B: deliberately restrict to biologically living allies as a new limitation.','Recommend A to avoid unsupported biological restriction. Preserve identity-specific roster and actual current alliance; no faction/alignment diagnostic, no automatic inclusion of new allies. Any source with a narrower target type still obeys it independently.'),
('MM7-Q11',['spell-sculptor'],'Exclusion covers direct creature payload, but real world consequences remain.','A: omit direct damage/save/condition/buff and coupled worn-item effects, retain actual ordinary terrain/support/obscurity and independent physical consequences. B: treat any physically described damage as unavoidable or let allies pass through solid walls.','Recommend A with actual mixed-source case. Magical hail direct bludgeoning damage is still parent damage; visual descriptions do not make it an independent mundane hazard. Parent duration and modifier60sec are separate, suppression never reverses a suffered event, and omitted recipients generate no save-success/avoided-damage proc.'),
('MM7-Q12',['spell-seal'],'Source cannot be dispelled; prior completion24h nonconcentration, no owner consent/rank cap, no spatial anchor.','A: preserve protection of one actual ongoing independently selectable application and Seal itself, ordinary expiry/dismissal/source endings unchanged. B: add permission/rank limit/spatial immobility from ResonanceSeal.','Recommend A as distinct explicit SpellSeal design. Whole indivisible field versus recipient-local applications stays source-defined. No frozen time, mandatory caster concentration, automatic protection of every sibling or completed mundane consequence.'),
('MM7-Q13',['spell-seal'],'Accepted ResonanceSeal excludes SpellSeal/ResonanceSeal/ResonanceAnchor but expressly did not amend unreviewed SpellSeal reciprocally.','A: explicitly add reciprocal exclusion of these three seal/anchor families to SpellSeal as a new local decision. B: retain only SpellSeal self/family exclusion and allow protection of the other eligible sources.','Recommend A to avoid cross-protection loopholes while preserving all three distinct originals. This must be actual new concurrence, not claimed as inherited approval. Neither option supplies a general inability to protect unrelated eligible high-rank magic.'),
('MM7-Q14',['spell-seal'],'Suppression may suspend protection, but accepted multi-dispel operations are captured before removals.','A: retain actual independent selective-removal requirement and no demonstrated LesserAntimagic+GreaterDispel shortcut. B: assume ending the field rescans parent/Seal in the same cast.','Recommend A. Same-field exemption targets only that field, not its suppressed Seal/parent. Preserve full AC5-ANTIMAGIC-IO-04 and AC6-SEAL-REMOVAL-01; a future explicit selective source must be actually supplied. No new dispel success is claimed from this hypothetical gap.'),
('MM7-Q15',['spell-theft','arcane-reversal','spell-seal'],'Theft rank<=4 whole permitted buff bundle, original owner/concentration, once-lifetime transfer, donor/recipient actual ending costs.','A: retain prior full package with donorWIS and current-source prerequisites; explicitly decide whether same-application attached Reversal/Seal modifiers follow that retained bundle identity. B: cherry-pick benefits, reset source flags or invent the missing Fly identity.','Recommend A, including true Haste FULLAction and accepted endingStun once on donor departure and eventual thief ending. If caster self-donor loses concentration through that Stun, received benefit can immediately end too; current cases must resolve that dependency. An ordinary generic named Fly is not present; use a genuinely existing acquired source or preserve the source example unresolved.'),
('MM7-Q16',['resonance-communion'],'Learn exactly3spells temporarily; prior completion1hour three additional class-qualified currently unavailable usable choices.','A: preserve actual single recipient-class profile, all genuinely unlocked ranks, reviewed ordinary IDs, atomic three/replacement and temporary known/prepared excess capacity. B: cantrips-only, grant arbitrary class access, free casts or lasting formulas.','Recommend A. Current authored-review membership is distinct from runtimeSelectionEnabled; define this manuscript playtest eligibility explicitly rather than enabling runtime selection. Grant expiry blocks new/unfinished knowledge-dependent casts but not genuinely completed casts/Ready release; independent real learning source may work only under its actual requirements. Historical Weave wording does not decide cosmology.')
]

def main():
    out=R/'data/director/spell_review/magic_modifiers_7_conference_01.json';root=A/'magic-modifiers7-conference-01';check=A/'MAGIC_MODIFIERS_7_CONFERENCE_01_CHECK.json';archive=A/'DD_Magic_Modifiers_7_Conference_01.zip';req=A/'MAGIC_MODIFIERS_7_CONFERENCE_01_REQUEST.txt';prep=A/'MAGIC_MODIFIERS_7_CONFERENCE_01_PREPARATION.json'
    assert all(not p.exists() for p in [out,root,check,archive,req,prep]);sources={};checks=[]
    def read(p):return json.loads(p.read_bytes())
    def bind(p):
        b=info(p);sources[b['path']]=b;return b
    def ck(label,v):
        checks.append({'check':label,'passed':bool(v)});assert v,label
    qp=R/'data/director/spell_review/remaining_work_queue_06.json';cp=R/'data/public/spell_playtests/catalog.json';ip=R/'data/public/spell_playtests/authored_review_index.json';rp=R/'data/director/spell_review/accepted_interface_registry_04.json';queue,catalog,index,reg=map(read,[qp,cp,ip,rp])
    for p in [qp,cp,ip,rp,R/'data/public/class_playtests/wizard.json',R/'data/public/class_playtests/cleric.json',R/'data/public/class_playtests/mage.json',R/'tools/prepare_magic_modifiers7_conference_01.py']:bind(p)
    for n in ['BODY_EQUIPMENT_PLAYTEST.md','COMBAT_ACTION_PLAYTEST.md','CONTROL_STATES_PLAYTEST.md','HEALING_DEATH_PLAYTEST.md','CREATURE_LIFECYCLE_PLAYTEST.md','DAMAGE_SHARING_PLAYTEST.md','MAXIMUM_HP_PLAYTEST.md','CHARACTER_CREATION_PLAYTEST.md','VIDEO_GAME_ONLY_DIRECTIVE.md']:bind(R/'docs/mechanics'/n)
    records=[];shared={};cases=[]
    for ident in IDS:
        row=next(r for r in queue['rows'] if r['id']==ident);ck('Not already queued '+ident,row['currentGroup'] is None);prior=row['previousAuthoringMapRowUnchanged']['completeEarlierProposalRecords'][0];p=G/prior['source']['path'];ck('Full original source '+ident,bind(p)==prior['source']);doc=read(p);rec=at(doc,prior['recordPointer']);card=next(s for s in catalog['spells'] if s['id']==ident);entry=next(e for e in index['entries'] if e['id']==ident)
        ck('Complete procedure '+ident,rec['spellId']==ident and len(rec['procedure'])>100);ck('Unchanged source/access '+ident,rec['fullSourceAndCurrentAccessRecord']==card);ck('Pending '+ident,entry['authoredStatus']=='pending-authored-procedure')
        records.append({'spellId':ident,'source':info(p),'pointer':prior['recordPointer'],'completeOriginalRecordUnchanged':deepcopy(rec),'completeCurrentCatalogSourceAndAccess':deepcopy(card),'indexEntry':deepcopy(entry),'riskTier':'C','status':'Earlier full proposal; design choices not adopted.'});shared[str(p)]={'source':info(p),'completeOriginalSharedProposalUnchanged':deepcopy(doc['sharedProposal']),'completeOriginalJointIssuesUnchanged':deepcopy(doc['explicitJointIssues'])}
        for n,t in enumerate(rec['workedCases']):cases.append({'id':t.split(':',1)[0],'spellId':ident,'originalTextUnchanged':t,'source':info(p),'pointer':prior['recordPointer']+f'/workedCases/{n}'})
        for key in ['catalog','core']:ck('Underlying '+key+' '+ident,bind(R/card['source'][key+'Path'])['sha256']==card['source'][key+'Sha256'])
    inherited=[]
    for n in list(range(15))+[21,25,26,36,39,40,49,50,51,55,67,80,81,82,86,91,92]:
        e=reg['entries'][n];b=e['currentAuthoritativeSource'];a=bind(G/b['path']);ck('Exact authority '+str(n),a['bytes']==b['bytes'] and a['sha256']==b['sha256']);inherited.append({'registryPointer':f'/entries/{n}','completeEntryUnchanged':deepcopy(e),'scopeLimit':'Exact accepted source only; conversion/theft/sculptor/new seal exceptions still require this conference.'})
    counterparts=[]
    for ident in ['mirror-image','haste','stoneflesh','summon-water-pet','conjure-elemental-lance','elemental-drain','spell-mirror','unravel-spell','resonance-seal','resonance-anchor','fireball','ice-storm']:
        entry=next(e for e in index['entries'] if e['id']==ident)
        if entry['authoredStatus']!='reviewed-authored-operational-playtest':
            ck('Explicit pending counterpart '+ident,ident=='ice-storm');continue
        p=(ip.parent/entry['procedureFile']).resolve();doc=read(p);ptr=entry.get('wholeCardPointer',entry['procedurePointer']);counterparts.append({'spellId':ident,'source':bind(p),'pointer':ptr,'completeCurrentCard':deepcopy(at(doc,ptr)),'completeSharedRules':deepcopy(doc.get('sharedRules',{})),'indexEntry':deepcopy(entry)})
    pending=[]
    for fn in ['persistent_damage_20_current_07.json','damage_control_25_current_09.json']:
        p=R/'data/director/spell_proposals'/fn;pending.append({'source':bind(p),'status':'Unaccepted full current proposal only; not an inherited rule grant.'})
    matches=[{'pointer':f'/spells/{n}','completeCard':deepcopy(s)} for n,s in enumerate(catalog['spells']) if re.search('heal|restore|regain',s['source']['original']['description'],re.I) and any(v['rank']<=4 for v in s['classAccess'].values())]
    questions=[{'id':qid,'spellIds':ids,'exactSourceOrConflict':src,'options':opts,'recommendationAndConsequences':rec,'decisionSelected':False} for qid,ids,src,opts,rec in FORKS]
    findings=[
        {'id':'MM7-F01','classification':'REAL COUNTERPART FOUND','finding':'Reviewed AC4 WaterPet is an ongoing rank4 spell with genuine2d6 healing and an explicit shared offensive/support budget. It has no healing reserve. Reversal would add a new exception to its ordinary no-conversion clause, so this is a conference choice, not already-permitted damage.'},
        {'id':'MM7-F02','classification':'UNSUPPORTED BIOLOGICAL LIMIT','finding':'SpellSculptor prior still-living ally wording may exclude valid active Undead/Construct allies without printed source support. QuestionQ10 asks explicitly whether to replace it with active same-creature eligibility.'},
        {'id':'MM7-F03','classification':'NEW RECIPROCAL SEAL CHOICE','finding':'Accepted ResonanceSeal excludes three seal/anchor families and explicitly leaves prior SpellSeal unchanged. Q13 requests actual reciprocal concurrence; the accepted exclusion cannot be silently claimed as an existing SpellSeal rule.'},
        {'id':'MM7-F04','classification':'ACTUAL REMOVAL LIMIT','finding':'LesserAntimagic suppresses parent/Seal termination operations; GreaterDispel captures immutable operations and does not rescan after removal. No demonstrated same-locus selective suppress-then-dispel escape exists.'},
        {'id':'MM7-F05','classification':'MISSING SOURCE AND LIFECYCLE DEPENDENCY','finding':'No exact Fly ordinary identity is present; Theft example remains preserved unresolved. Self-concentrating Haste donor endingStun may terminate concentration immediately, so a transferred duration is conditional on a real unaffected original concentration owner.'},
        {'id':'MM7-F06','classification':'EXACT DEFENSE ORDER','finding':'Rebind failed5d10=28 minus actual applicable flatDR3 is25 if no remaining defense; success29 half floors14 then resistance7. These are conditional arithmetic obligations, not a sourced full encounter or root/Null proof.'},
        {'id':'MM7-F07','classification':'MANUSCRIPT VERSUS RUNTIME ACCESS','finding':'Communion proposes using currently reviewed authored IDs in an explicitly local manuscript playtest. This does not flip runtimeSelectionEnabled, grant unreviewed identities or certify implementation.'},
    ]
    ck('Seven unique pending identities',len(records)==len(set(IDS))==7);ck('Fourteen originals',len(cases)==len({c['id'] for c in cases})==14);ck('Sixteen questions',len(questions)==16);ck('Counts unchanged',index['authoredCounts']=={'reviewed':480,'pending':368});ck('Sculptor separate RP costs',40-13-5==22);ck('Rebind conditional failed arithmetic',28-3==25);ck('Rebind conditional success arithmetic',(29//2)//2==7);ck('Combined candidates original obligation',1+3+1==5);ck('No invented Fly identity',not any(s['id']=='fly' for s in catalog['spells']))
    root.mkdir();frozen=[]
    for b in sources.values():
        p=G/b['path'];ck('Source unchanged '+b['path'],info(p)==b);dst=root/'sources'/b['path'];dst.parent.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);dst.write_bytes(p.read_bytes());ck('Frozen source bytes '+b['path'],dst.read_bytes()==p.read_bytes());frozen.append({**b,'frozenCopy':dst.relative_to(G).as_posix()})
    result={'id':'MAGIC-MODIFIERS-7-CONFERENCE-01','recordedAtUtc':datetime.now(timezone.utc).isoformat(),'status':'PREAUTHORSHIP_CONFERENCE_PREPARED_UNSENT','developmentDirection':'video-game-only','records':records,'all14OriginalScenarios':cases,'completeOriginalSharedProposalsUnchanged':list(shared.values()),'sharedRouting':'Only source-specific actual rules apply; old shared Wizard cadence and prior unadopted counterpart labels are historical, not current authority. These seven proposals may alter other sources only through explicit locally scoped accepted decisions.','currentAcceptedInterfaceComparisons':inherited,'completeAcceptedCounterparts':counterparts,'pendingComparisons':pending,'catalogHealingSourceSearch':{'source':info(cp),'scope':'All original catalog descriptions matching heal/restore/regain case-insensitively with at least one class rank<=4; bounded source search, not exhaustive semantic proof.','completeMatchingCards':matches},'semanticDelta':[{'spellId':r['spellId'],'riskTier':'C','fullEarlierNewChoices':r['completeOriginalRecordUnchanged']['newChoices'],'genuineQuestionIds':[q['id'] for q in questions if r['spellId'] in q['spellIds']]} for r in records],'questions':questions,'findings':findings,'riskCounts':{'C':7},'currentVectors':[],'currentVectorScope':'Zero new complete current encounters. Fourteen preserved original scenario obligations include explicitly synthetic/unbound premises; these are not claimed as full source-qualified current cases. Author complete current cases after actual choices.','sourceBindings':list(sources.values()),'countsUnchanged':{'reviewed':480,'pending':368},'newRuleAdoptions':0,'runtimeTestsExecuted':0,'humanPlaytests':0,'cosmologyDecisions':0,'sourceInformationDeleted':0}
    out.write_bytes(encoded(result));check.write_bytes(encoded({'candidate':info(out),'checks':checks,'checkCount':len(checks),'sourceCount':len(sources),'fullProcedures':7,'originalCases':14,'newCurrentVectors':0,'questions':16,'failures':0,'validationScope':'Exact sources/access/history/membership and limited conditional arithmetic; no final semantic acceptance or runtime.'}))
    (root/'MANIFEST.json').write_bytes(encoded({'candidate':info(out),'check':info(check),'files':list(sources.values()),'frozenSources':frozen,'sourceCount':len(sources),'newRuleAdoptions':0}))
    (root/'README.md').write_text('''# Magic modifiers7 preauthorship conference01

Read all seven complete earlier proposals, fourteen unchanged original scenario obligations, current accepted counterparts and sixteen actual decision questions. Zero new complete current encounters are submitted. This is discussion before new systemic authorship and final exact review, not an acceptance request.

ArcaneClone would add a specific combined MirrorImage decoy selection, not a creature. ArcaneReversal would add a bounded five-pair conversion with actual source funding and explicit root mapping. WaterPet supplies a genuine rank4 healing action and already shares the offensive/support budget, but has no healing reserve; its no-conversion baseline needs the new explicit exception. The original reserve example remains synthetic. ElementalRebind selects a declared five-type set and overlays only covered immunity/resistance, leaving independent protections and source history. Sculptor needs explicit active-creature versus biological-living choice and real direct-payload versus physical consequence distinctions.

SpellSeal is distinct from accepted spatial ResonanceSeal. Reciprocal exclusion of the three seal/anchor families is a new question, not inherited authority. Accepted LesserAntimagic/GreaterDispel do not demonstrate selective same-locus removal. Theft preserves original source/concentration and actual Haste endingStun; a self-concentrating donor can immediately end that source. The printed exact Fly identity is still missing and is not invented. Communion proposes manuscript reviewed-ID access only, with three genuinely available class-qualified choices and no runtime-selection activation or cosmological interpretation.

Return downloadable complete per-spell/per-question dispositions, source-linked full replacements when needed, and current-case requirements. Retain every original.480reviewed/368pending unchanged. No adoption, runtime/human/balance/cosmology/75-domain/whole-game/release approval.
''',encoding='utf8',newline='\n')
    with zipfile.ZipFile(archive,'x',zipfile.ZIP_DEFLATED,compresslevel=9) as z:
        for n in ['README.md','MANIFEST.json']:z.write(root/n,n)
        z.write(out,'CANDIDATE.json');z.write(check,'PREFLIGHT.json')
        for b in frozen:z.write(G/b['frozenCopy'],'sources/'+b['path'])
    with zipfile.ZipFile(archive) as z:
        assert z.testzip() is None and z.read('CANDIDATE.json')==out.read_bytes()
        for b in frozen:assert z.read('sources/'+b['path'])==(G/b['frozenCopy']).read_bytes()
    b=info(archive);req.write_text(f'Please conduct MagicModifiers7 preauthorship conference using {archive.name} ({b["bytes"]}bytes;SHA256 {b["sha256"]}). Read all7 complete original procedures,14 unchanged scenario obligations,16questions and all current sources. Zero new current encounter vectors are submitted. Resolve bounded clone/decoy selection, Reversal actual output conversion/roots, Rebind defense overlay, Sculptor active-ally/direct-payload scope, SpellSeal reciprocal exclusions/removal, Theft retained source/Haste dependencies and Communion class-qualified temporary access. WaterPet has a real healing action but no reserve; no generic Fly source is invented. Return downloadable full dispositions and exact source-linked proposed replacements with current-case requirements.480/368 unchanged; no adoption/runtime/human/balance/cosmology/domain closure.\n',encoding='utf8',newline='\n');prep.write_bytes(encoded({'archive':b,'candidate':info(out),'manifest':info(root/'MANIFEST.json'),'check':info(check),'request':info(req),'sourceCount':len(sources),'allArchiveSourcesVerified':True,'status':'Prepared UNSENT; actual GPT conference tracked separately.','newRuleAdoptions':0}));print(json.dumps({'archive':b,'candidate':info(out),'preparation':info(prep),'sources':len(sources),'checks':len(checks),'originalCases':14,'questions':16}))

if __name__=='__main__':main()
